 campaign egomaniac and  narcissist  at the time you didn't think he was good  for the country how do you go from that  to voting for someone who you don't  think great question is is a good  actually I actually publicly endorsed  him in the Wall Street Journal I wrote  an op-ed that spring saying I don't  expect him to be the next great  statesman I didn't vote for him thinking  that all my opinions didn't suddenly  change yeah I voted for him for two  reasons I said one I think there he will  try to repeal Obamacare I think there  was a chance he'll try to appoint  conservative judges I don't know if he  will I didn't kill her what because I  know they're counting it down how do you  think he's doing now on policy I think  he's done better than I expected like  many of his supporters I wish didn't  tweet as much I wish he didn't go thank  you thank you right back
 

